      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "intro",
      "text": "Aspose.Slides FOSS for .NET exposes the Aspose.Slides FOSS for .NET class as its primary entry point for working with presentations, and Aspose.Slides.Foss.Export.SaveFormat as the enumeration that defines supported output formats."
    },
