      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:aspose.slides.foss",
      "text": "The Aspose.Slides FOSS for .NET class provides core presentation functionality, including loading and saving presentations in PPTX, PPT, PPSX, and other formats supported by the SaveFormat enumeration, while mirroring the naming of the commercial Aspose.Slides for .NET product so its documentation serves as a reference for shared type meanings."
    },
